<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0370_R27R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Where you goin’ with your homies?\rThe Big League?\rYour homies loyal enough for you to\nwin? Lemme read ’em. I’m a homie\fwhisperer.\fSelf-certified.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0370_R27R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ah! Your homie TRUST you for real.\nIt look at you like you hung the moon.\rHere. A gift for the road.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0370_R27R0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">TM37 is Dust Up.\rIt hit your homies AND\nthe other homies.\rBut some homies, like Rock-,\nGround-, and Steel-types,\fdon’t take no damage.\rThere’s other ways to dodge\nit too. I’ll let you figure it out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0370_R27R0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it don’t start trustin’ you more,\nit could get ROUGH.\rTrust is what tie homies and Hustlers\ntogether. Like duct tape. Emotional\fduct tape.</language>
	</row>
</body>
